	"system": {
		"description": "<p>By blasting a powerful note on this ram’s horn instrument as an action, you grant all allies within 30ft expertise on their next attack roll. Using this ability takes one charge from the horn which has a maximum of 10 charges. At the end of a long rest, roll [[/r 1d6]] to see how many charges are recovered. Whenever the last charge is expended, roll [[/r 1d20]]. On a 1, the horn cracks and loses all magical power. In addition, when a bard uses this horn to perform the @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.dcl4v0rzoyyif9pw]{Ode of Blood} battle hymn, the target is no longer incapacitated until they take damage under the hymn’s effect.</p>",
